title: IntroDialogue
---
<<declare $playerName="player">>
<<gatherVars>>
<<declare $WakeAnimBool = true>>
It bleared in your ears invasively, your beloved alarm...
A groan slipped out as you blinked away the sleep in order to slap the stop button. 
You were hardly awake, swaying as you patted your desk for your phone. 
When your hand grabbed it, you had sleepily opened your eyes to glance at the time.

0500


You sighed. This was one of the aspects of University you did not like; 
waking up at the ass crack of dawn just so to catch one stupid bus to the campus. 
Of course the last semester of the year was the slowest, the irony made you scoff.

<<set $WakeAnimBool = false>>
Throwing the duvets off yourself, the chilly morning air instantly hit and made 
you shiver as you got up and started your day. 
You at least had time to grab breakfast before going...

===

title: CookingBreakfast
---
What's for breakfast?
-> Bacon and Eggs
    <<jump Protein>>
-> Fruit & Yoghurt Bowl 
    <<jump Vitamins>>
-> Lunar Loops
    <<jump Sugar>>

===

title: LeavingForClass
---
With a sigh and a groan, you locked the door and set off for the bus station. 
The cold, chilly air hit you hard, the air you breathed out 
visible in the crisp air.

The weather had you silently wishing you could hop back onto 
your warm and cosy bed, but sadly, you had to 
go into University today or else you will be penalised. 
Remembering that pissed you off.
===

title: Protein
---
You grab eggs and bacon and flick on the stove, 
caring more about the taste than the protein.
===

title: Vitamins
---
You grab fruit and yoghurt from the fridge before 
chopping and mixing it together. 
For once, you felt like having a healthy breakfast.
===

title: Sugar
---
You grab a box of the only cereal you ever bought, the sugar mainly being why.
Besides, it was handier than the other options...
===
